#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can [download](/apps/) the [mobile and desktop apps](/apps/).\n"
"Zulip also works great in a browser.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Du kan [hämta](/apps/) och [mobil- och skrivbordsappar](/apps/).\n"
"Zulip fungerar också utmärkt i en webbläsare.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"Go to [Profile settings](#settings/profile) to add a [profile picture](/help/"
"change-your-profile-picture)\n"
"and edit your [profile information](/help/edit-your-profile).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Gå till [Profilinställningar](#settings/profile) för att lägga till en "
"[profilbild](/help/change-your-profile-picture)\n"
"och redigera din [profilinformation](/help/edit-your-profile).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can switch between [light and dark theme](/help/dark-theme), [pick your\n"
"favorite emoji set](/help/emoji-and-emoticons#change-your-emoji-set), "
"[change\n"
"your language](/help/change-your-language), and otherwise customize your "
"Zulip\n"
"experience in your [Preferences](#settings/preferences).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Du kan växla mellan [ljust och mörkt tema](/help/dark-theme), [välja din\n"
"favorituppsättning med emojier](/help/emoji-and-emoticons#change-your-emoji-"
"set),\n"
"[ändra språk](/help/change-your-language) och anpassa Zulip på andra sätt "
"under\n"
"[Inställningar](#settings/preferences).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Channels organize conversations based on who needs to see them. For "
"example,\n"
"it's common to have a channel for each team in an organization.\n"
"\n"
"[Browse and subscribe to channels]({settings_link}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Kanaler organiserar konversationer utifrån vem som behöver se dem. Till "
"exempel,\n"
"det är vanligt att ha en kanal för varje team i en organisation.\n"
"\n"
"[Bläddra bland och prenumerera på kanaler]({settings_link}).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"[Topics](/help/introduction-to-topics) summarize what each conversation in "
"Zulip\n"
"is about. You can read Zulip one topic at a time, seeing each message in\n"
"context, no matter how many other conversations are going on.\n"
"\n"
"When you start a conversation, label it with a new topic. For a good topic "
"name,\n"
"think about finishing the sentence: “Hey, can we chat about…?”\n"
"\n"
"Check out [Recent conversations](#recent) for a list of topics that are "
"being\n"
"discussed.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"[Ämnen](/help/introduction-to-topics) sammanfattar vad varje konversation i\n"
"Zulip handlar om. Du kan läsa Zulip ett ämne i taget och se varje meddelande "
"i\n"
"sitt sammanhang, oavsett hur många andra konversationer som pågår.\n"
"\n"
"När du startar en konversation ger du den ett nytt ämne. Ett bra sätt att "
"välja\n"
"ämnesnamn är att avsluta meningen: ”Hej, kan vi prata om…?”\n"
"\n"
"Under [Senaste konversationer](#recent) finns en lista över ämnen som "
"diskuteras.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"Zulip's [keyboard shortcuts](#keyboard-shortcuts) let you navigate the app\n"
"quickly and efficiently.\n"
"\n"
"Press `?` any time to see a [cheat sheet](#keyboard-shortcuts).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Zulips [kortkommandon](#keyboard-shortcuts) låter dig navigera i appen\n"
"snabbt och effektivt.\n"
"\n"
"Tryck på `?` när som helst för att se en [snabbguide](#keyboard-shortcuts).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can **format** *your* `message` using the handy formatting buttons, or "
"by\n"
"typing your formatting with Markdown.\n"
"\n"
"Check out the [cheat sheet](#message-formatting) to learn about spoilers, "
"global\n"
"times, and more.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Du kan **formatera** *ditt* `message` med de praktiska "
"formateringsknapparna\n"
"eller genom att skriva Markdown.\n"
"\n"
"I [snabbguiden](#message-formatting) kan du läsa om spoilertext, globala\n"
"klockslag och mycket annat.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Here are a few messages I understand: {bot_commands}\n"
"\n"
"Check out our [Getting started guide](/help/getting-started-with-zulip),\n"
"or browse the [help center](/help/) to learn more!\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Här är några meddelanden som jag förstår: {bot_commands}\n"
"\n"
"Läs vår [kom igång-guide](/help/getting-started-with-zulip) eller bläddra i\n"
"[hjälpcentret](/help/) om du vill veta mer!\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can chat with me as much as you like! To\n"
"get help, try one of the following messages: {bot_commands}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Du kan chatta med mig så mycket du vill! Till\n"
"få hjälp, försök med något av följande meddelanden: {bot_commands}\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"If anything is out of place, it’s easy to [move messages]"
"({move_content_another_topic_help_url}),\n"
"[rename]({rename_topic_help_url}) and [split]"
"({move_content_another_topic_help_url}) topics,\n"
"or even move a topic [to a different channel]"
"({move_content_another_channel_help_url}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Om något är fel är det lätt att [flytta meddelanden]"
"({move_content_another_topic_help_url}),\n"
"[byta namn]({rename_topic_help_url}) och [dela]"
"({move_content_another_topic_help_url}) ämnen,\n"
"eller till och med flytta ett ämne [till en annan kanal]"
"({move_content_another_channel_help_url}).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right: Try moving this message to another topic and back.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right: Försök att flytta detta meddelande till ett annat ämne och "
"tillbaka.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"Zulip is organized to help you communicate more efficiently. Conversations "
"are\n"
"labeled with topics, which summarize what the conversation is about.\n"
"\n"
"For example, this message is in the “{topic_name}” topic in the\n"
"#**{zulip_discussion_channel_name}** channel, as you can see in the left "
"sidebar\n"
"and above.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Zulip är organiserat för att hjälpa dig att kommunicera mer effektivt. "
"Konversationer är\n"
"märkt med ämnen, som sammanfattar vad samtalet handlar om.\n"
"\n"
"Till exempel finns det här meddelandet i \"{topic_name}\"-ämnet i\n"
"#**{zulip_discussion_channel_name}** kanal, som du kan se i det vänstra "
"sidofältet\n"
"och över.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid "welcome to Zulip!"
msgstr "välkommen till Zulip!"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"You can read Zulip one conversation at a time, seeing each message in "
"context,\n"
"no matter how many other conversations are going on.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Du kan läsa Zulip en konversation i taget, se varje meddelande i sitt "
"sammanhang,\n"
"oavsett hur många andra samtal som pågår.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right: When you're ready, check out your [Inbox](/#inbox) for other\n"
"conversations with unread messages.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right: När du är redo, kolla in din [Inkorg](/#inbox) för andra\n"
"konversationer med olästa meddelanden.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"To kick off a new conversation, pick a channel in the left sidebar, and "
"click\n"
"the `+` button next to its name.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"För att starta en ny konversation, välj en kanal i det vänstra sidofältet "
"och klicka\n"
"knappen `+` bredvid dess namn.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"Label your conversation with a topic. Think about finishing the sentence: "
"“Hey,\n"
"can we chat about…?”\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Ge konversationen ett ämne. Tänk dig att ämnesnamnet avslutar meningen: "
"”Hej,\n"
"kan vi prata om…?”\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right: Try starting a new conversation in this channel.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right: Testa att starta en ny konversation i den här kanalen.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right:  Use this topic to try out [Zulip's messaging features]"
"({format_message_help_url}).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right: Använd detta ämne för att prova [Zulips meddelandefunktioner]"
"({format_message_help_url}).\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"```spoiler Want to see some examples?\n"
"\n"
"````python\n"
"\n"
"print(\"code blocks\")\n"
"\n"
"````\n"
"\n"
"- bulleted\n"
"- lists\n"
"\n"
"Link to a conversation: #**{zulip_discussion_channel_name}>{topic_name}**\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"```spoiler Vill du se några exempel?\n"
"\n"
"````python\n"
"\n"
"print(\"code blocks\")\n"
"\n"
"````\n"
"\n"
"- punktlistor\n"
"- med flera poster\n"
"\n"
"Länk till en konversation: #**{zulip_discussion_channel_name}>{topic_name}"
"**\n"
"\n"
"```\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
"This **greetings** topic is a great place to say “hi” :wave: to your "
"teammates.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Det här **hälsningsämnet** är ett bra ställe att säga \"hej\" :wave: till "
"dina lagkamrater.\n"

#: zerver/lib/onboarding.py
msgid ""
"\n"
":point_right: Click on this message to start a new message in the same "
"conversation.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
":point_right: Klicka på det här meddelandet för att starta ett nytt "
"meddelande i samma konversation.\n"

